<title>USA: Apple South names senior vice president.</title>
<headline>Apple South names senior vice president.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Ga. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple South Inc said Friday it has named Louis Profumo senior vice president of planning and acquisitions.</p>
<p>The company said the post is a newly-created one at the company.</p>
</text>
